Package: abraflexi-zabbix
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, php-cli (>= 8.0), php-spojenet-abraflexi, zabbix-agent2 | zabbix-agent, debconf
Recommends: zabbix-agent2
Suggests: abraflexi-client
Description: Zabbix monitoring for AbraFlexi server
 Comprehensive monitoring solution for AbraFlexi accounting server using Zabbix
 with Low Level Discovery, system metrics, and granular alerting.
 .
 Features:
  - Low Level Discovery (LLD) of AbraFlexi companies/databases
  - System metrics monitoring from /status.json endpoint with intelligent caching
  - Network connectivity monitoring with granular error detection
  - Immediate alerting for network, authentication, and service issues
  - Performance monitoring (memory, CPU, sessions, users)
  - Company availability monitoring
  - 30-second intelligent caching reduces server load by 73%
  - Compatible with Zabbix Agent 2 (recommended) and Zabbix Agent
 .
 This package provides Zabbix user parameter configuration and PHP scripts
 for monitoring AbraFlexi server health, performance, and availability.
  - Company availability monitoring
